Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Removes "Open in Claude Code" from the Explorer right-click menu for the current user.
; The leading "-" deletes each key along with its command subkey.

[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\Directory\Background\shell\OpenInClaudeCode]

[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\Directory\shell\OpenInClaudeCode]
